        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of clinical symptoms plus characteristic imaging findings and either histopathologic confirmation or compatible pulmonary function tests",
    "notes": "Histopathology is gold standard but often diagnosis is clinical-radiologic due to biopsy risks"
